      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but i'm not like... drinking a whole bottle lol. it's literally just one small glass of red wine to relax. i feel like the alcohol might actually help the ambien work better so i don't just lay there awake. are you sure it's a big deal if it's just a little bit?",
